hadiths[9]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1061","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) Khaibar ke sau hisson ke malik bane jo unhon ne khareede the, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhe aisa maal mila hai jaisa mujhe kabhi nahin mila, aur main ne irada kiya hai ke is ke zariye Allah Ta'ala ka qurb hasil karun. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Asl ko rok lo aur phal ko Allah ki rah mein jari kar do.'"
"1062","[AI-translation] Mujhe Ibn Habib Qazi ne khabar di aur woh Umar bin Habib hain, Ibn Aun se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se ke Hazrat Umar ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhe Khaibar se aisa maal mila hai ke mujhe is se pahle is se zyada pasandeeda aur apne nazdeek is se bada maal kabhi nahin mila tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar tum chaho to is ki asl ko rok lo aur is ke phal ko jari kar do.' Phir Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne use sadqa kar diya, phir unhon ne apne sadqe ka tareeqa bayan kiya."
"1063","[AI-translation] Hamen Sufyan bin Uyainah ne khabar di, Abdullah bin Umar se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhe aisa maal mila hai jaisa mujhe pahle kabhi nahin mila, aur main ne is ke zariye Allah ka qurb hasil karne ka irada kiya hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Is ki asl ko rok lo aur is ke phal ko jari kar do.'"
"1064","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo shakhs kisi ko umra de us ke liye aur us ki nasal ke liye to woh usi ka ho jaega jise diya gaya, aur dene wale ki taraf nahin lautega, is liye ke us ne aisa atiya diya jis mein miras jari ho gai.'"
"1065","[AI-translation] Sulaiman bin Yasar se riwayat hai ke Tariq ne Madinah mein umra ka faisla Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke qaul ke mutabiq kiya."
"1066","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne umra ko waris ke liye qarar diya."
"1067","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Umra aur ruqba ke andaz mein atiya mat karo, jis ne koi cheez umra ya ruqba ki to woh miras ke tareeq par hai.'"
"1068","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jis ne koi cheez umra ki to woh usi ki hai.'"
"1069","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Umra waris ke liye hai.'"
